## Plan before complex work
Use Plan Mode (Shift+Tab) for multi-file features, architecture, or unclear scope.
Save approved plans to `.cursor/plans/` when useful for CRM-AI.

## Agent usage
- Use Background / Cloud Agents for parallel tasks (tests, docs, refactors).
- Use subagents for exploration vs implementation separation.
- Prefer `@` file references over pasting large code blocks.

## Cost control
- Keep always-on rules short; use skills for long checklists.
- Enable llmlingua-compressor MCP for large tool outputs when available.
